---
description: |
  Matches events against the SOC Prime behavior rules.

  The operator runs the Sigma rules of the bundled SOC Prime detection
  content with the `sigma` operator and emits an OCSF Detection Finding per
  match. On OCSF events, the rules match through the Sigma-to-OCSF mapping of
  the `sigma` operator; rules whose fields have no OCSF representation are
  skipped with a warning.
---

sigma rules=socprime::$rules.entries().map(rule => rule.value)
